## 14. SOC Investigation Report Template

```text
Alert / Investigation Name:
SSH Authentication Activity

Host:
[Observed hostname]

Time Window:
[Start time – End time]

Target Usernames:
[Observed usernames]

Source IPs:
[Observed source addresses]

Failed Attempts:
[Observed count]

Successful Login:
[Yes / No / Unknown]

Related Sudo Activity:
[Observed details or Unknown]

Evidence:
[Relevant log entries and timestamps]

Initial Assessment:
[Expected / Suspicious / Inconclusive]

Reason:
[Explain what the evidence supports]

Recommended Next Step:
[Validate activity, continue investigation,
